// Title: PowerShell SAM Copy
// ID: 1af57a4b-460a-4738-9034-db68b880c665
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-07-29
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.002
// Description: Detects suspicious PowerShell scripts accessing SAM hives
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_\\HarddiskVolumeShadowCopy*" and process.command_line like "*_System32\\config\\sam*")) and ((process.command_line like "*_Copy-Item*" or process.command_line like "*_cp $_.*" or process.command_line like "*_cpi $_.*" or process.command_line like "*_copy $_.*" or process.command_line like "*_.File]::Copy(*")))
